      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOYARRA ELDER (1) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with his maiden win, then finished a 3.5 lengths second last start at Bendigo over 425m (24.12). Returns to the course where he won his maiden. Good run latest and can go on with it. SCOTT QUIBBLE (2) did a good job to finish third last time out over 390m at Ballarat (23.62) in a T3 Grade 7, the second top-three finish on the trot. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SO HOT SWIFTY (8) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run. Something for the Multiples: RED (7)",
